ite_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-06-17T07:56:56Z","label":{"name":"no-stale-bot","color":"6ECABC"},"intent":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":26868552594,"node_id":"SE_lADOEFLz888AAAABFlEpMc8AAAAGQX2Tkg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/26868552594","actor":{"login":"olemyhre","id":6302887,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDI4ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6302887?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre","html_url":"https://github.com/olemyhre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/olemyhre/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-06-17T15:26:22Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4879253307","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3316#issuecomment-4879253307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3316","id":4879253307,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABItN_Ow","user":{"login":"maximilize","id":3752128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTIxMjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3752128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize","html_url":"https://github.com/maximilize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-03T20:45:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T20:45:51Z","body":"Both behaviours here are the documented tailscaled MagicDNS semantics rather than a headscale bug — here's the mechanism.\n\n**Why a record outside `base_domain` doesn't resolve (case 1).** headscale only marks a name as \"route this to MagicDNS\" for `base_domain` + search domains and for explicitly configured split-DNS nameservers — `ExtraRecords` are passed through verbatim with no matching suffix generated (`hscontrol/types/config.go`: `cfg.ExtraRecords = dns.ExtraRecords`, `cfg.Routes = splitResolvers()`, `cfg.Domains = [BaseDomain]+SearchDomains`). On the client, a static record only resolves if the query is actually routed to the internal resolver, and Tailscale documents exactly this on the `Hosts` field:\n\n> Adding an entry to Hosts merely creates the record. If you want it to resolve, you also need to add appropriate routes to Routes. — `tailscale.com/net/dns/config.go`\n\nWith native split-DNS (systemd-resolved / Windows NRPT) the OS only forwards suffixes in `MatchDomains` (= the keys of `Routes`, `net/dns/config.go` `matchDomains()`) to `100.100.100.100`; a name outside every route/suffix goes to the system resolver and the extra record is never consulted.\n\n**Why adding a split-DNS entry makes the static record \"win\" (case 2).** That split entry creates a `Routes` suffix, so the client now routes the name to the internal resolver — and there `resolveLocal` checks the host table *before* forwarding (`net/dns/resolver/tsdns.go`: `hosts[domain]` is matched at the top, forwarding only happens on the `RCodeRefused` fall-through). So the static record answers instead of your `1.1.1.1` resolver.\n\nOne caveat that explains the \"odd/inconsistent\" feel: on Apple platforms (and whenever Tailscale is set as a *global* resolver) everything is intercepted, so an extra record resolves even without a matching route (`net/dns/manager.go`, the non-split-DNS branch). So the \"outside base_domain\" case is platform-dependent.\n\nNet: resolving arbitrary names outside `base_domain` would require headscale to emit a matching route/suffix for them, which is a feature rather than a fix.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4879253307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"maximilize","id":3752128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTIxMjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3752128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize","html_url":"https://github.com/maximilize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":27683321210,"node_id":"RTE_lADOEFLz888AAAABFlEpMc8AAAAGcg31eg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/27683321210","actor":{"login":"j-heffron","id":141463227,"node_id":"U_kgDOCG6Ouw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141463227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron","html_url":"https://github.com/j-heffron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j-heffron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-07-07T20:10:22Z","rename":{"from":"[Bug] Extra Records Odd Propagation Behavior for Records Outside Base Domain","to":"[Feature] DNS - Allow Emitting Routes for Domain Names Outside of base_domain / Arbitrary DNS Records"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/4908233109","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/issues/3316#issuecomment-4908233109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3316","id":4908233109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz888AAAABJI2xlQ","user":{"login":"j-heffron","id":141463227,"node_id":"U_kgDOCG6Ouw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.